      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "14.7 m",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "44.1 m",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "155.9 m",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "185.3 m",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "c",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "3 s এ পতন \\( s = \\frac{1}{2}gt^2 = \\frac{1}{2}\\times9.8\\times3^2 = 44.1\\,\\mathrm{m} \\)\nমাটি থেকে উচ্চতা \\( = 200 - 44.1 = 155.9\\,\\mathrm{m} \\)",
